# Environments

- **Production**: git `main` → https://www.chenguo.dev (Vercel Production env)
- **Staging**: git `staging` → https://staging.chenguo.dev (Vercel **Preview** env)
- PR `*.vercel.app`: UI smoke only; do login/write tests on staging

Do not invent a third long-lived hostname unless asked. Do not re-implement deploys in GitHub Actions; Vercel Git integration owns runtime deploys. CI is lint/typecheck/build only.

When changing auth, DB writes, uploads, or env handling: verify on staging before merging to `main`. See `docs/staging.md`.
